d bones on the side as seen  on the pirate ship belonging to tetra  the statue on the front of the ship also  known as the figurehead looks to be that  of a person praying a stark contrast to  the more menacing serpent-like statue  seen on the pirate ship all this leads  me to believe that this was not a pirate  ship but instead something akin to a  private or commercial vessel second is  the fact that although the ship seems  relatively harmless to link himself it  is known to have caused some serious  damage to others the man who drew the  ghost ship chart and mapped out the  ship's movement is said to have died a  most unexpected death then there's lenzo  the photographer at windfall island who  managed to snap a picture of the ghost  ship he claims to have gotten  shipwrecked right before it made its  appearance and david junior one of  tingle's uh  helpers is said to have been in pursuit  of the treasure aboard the ghost ship  before being washed up on tingo island  and his now deceased father is said to  have seen the haunted vessel as well it  could even be that the man who died  shortly after mapping out the ship's  movement is none other than david's  father so whatever the intentions of  those in control of the ship are they  are no stranger to causing harm and even  death to those trying to unravel its  secrets what's also interesting is the  location where the ghost ship chart is  found which is inside a cave on diamond  step island the cave looks to be some  sort of ship graveyard what these old  worn down ships are doing down here is a  complete mystery why are they on the  ground and how did they even get here  nintendo black crisis once suggested to  me that the water levels of the great  sea may have been different in the past  either higher or lower this would  explain why these shipwrecks are located  deep down as the island itself may have  at one point had an entrance leading to  its interior which could have collapsed  as the sea level started 